        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: ಮಾಧ್ಯಮ",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಧ್ಯಮ — mādhyama — \"the media; a medium\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಧ್ಯಮಗಳು ಆ ಘಟನೆಯ ಬಗ್ಗೆ ದಿನವಿಡೀ ಮಾತಾಡಿದವು. mādhyamagaḷu ā ghaṭaneya bagge dinaviḍī mātāḍidavu. The media talked about that incident all day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Also a medium of teaching: ಕನ್ನಡ ಮಾಧ್ಯಮ (mādhyama) ಶಾಲೆ, a Kannada-medium school."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಮಾಧ್ಯಮ (mādhyama) is borrowed from Sanskrit mādhyama, \"relating to the middle, central\" (Monier-Williams), from madhya, \"middle\" (CDIAL 9804); the sense \"a medium, the media\" is modern."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 3,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "One more word for telling what happened."
            }
          ]
        },
