          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾಹಿನಿ — vāhini — \"a TV channel\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಈ ವಾಹಿನಿಯಲ್ಲಿ ದಿನವಿಡೀ ಸುದ್ದಿ ಬರುತ್ತದೆ. ī vāhiniyalli dinaviḍī suddi baruttade. This channel has news all day."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Plural: ವಾಹಿನಿಗಳು, vāhinigaḷu."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸುದ್ದಿ ವಾಹಿನಿ (vāhini), a news channel."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾಹಿನಿ (vāhini) is borrowed from Sanskrit vāhinī, \"an army\", and in later use \"a river\", that which flows and carries (Monier-Williams); the sense \"a channel\" is modern."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
