          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾರ್ತೆ — vārte — \"a news bulletin; news\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಅಜ್ಜ ಪ್ರತಿದಿನ ರಾತ್ರಿ ಎಂಟು ಗಂಟೆಯ ವಾರ್ತೆ ಕೇಳುತ್ತಾರೆ. ajja pratidina rātri eṇṭu gaṇṭeya vārte kēḷuttāre. Grandfather listens to the eight o'clock news bulletin every night."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾರ್ತೆ (vārte) is the formal word on radio and television; in talk people say ಸುದ್ದಿ."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ವಾರ್ತೆ (vārte) is borrowed from Sanskrit vārttā, \"an account of what has happened, tidings, news\" (Monier-Williams)."
            }
          ]
        },
