            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಘೋಷಿಸು — ghōṣisu — \"to announce; to declare\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಸರ್ಕಾರ ನಾಳೆ ರಜೆ ಅಂತ ಘೋಷಿಸಿತು. sarkāra nāḷe raje anta ghōṣisitu. The government announced that tomorrow is a holiday."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Past (I …): ಘೋಷಿಸಿದೆ, ghōṣiside."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "What is announced comes before ಎಂದು or ಅಂತ: ರಜೆ ಅಂತ ಘೋಷಿಸು (ghōṣisu)."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "etymology",
          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಘೋಷಿಸು (ghōṣisu) is built on Sanskrit ghoṣa, \"a noise, the cry of a crowd\", whose derivative ghoṣaṇā means \"a proclamation\" (Monier-Williams), with the Kannada verb ending -isu."
            }
          ]
