              "text": "ಹೇಳಿಕೆ — hēḷike — \"a statement\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಪೊಲೀಸರ ಹೇಳಿಕೆ ಎಲ್ಲ ಪತ್ರಿಕೆಗಳಲ್ಲಿ ಬಂತು. polīsara hēḷike ella patrikegaḷalli bantu. The police statement appeared in every newspaper."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೇಳು, to say, with -ಇಕೆ, which makes a noun of a verb: what is said."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
