          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "ಹೇಳಿಕೆ (hēḷike) is a native Kannada noun made from the verb hēḷu, \"to say\" (DEDR 4430), with the ending -ike that turns verbs into nouns."
            }
